{"ref":"relic:chaos-malachite","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Chaos Malachite is a relic located in ",{"t":"Bat Country","r":"stage:bat-country"},". Once collected, it permanently allows ",{"i":"Sprite-Mortaccio.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:mortaccio"}," ",{"t":"Mortaccio","r":"character:mortaccio"}," to morph ",{"i":"Sprite-Bone.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:bone"}," ",{"t":"Bone","r":"weapon:bone"}," into ",{"i":"Sprite-Anima_of_Mortaccio.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:anima-of-mortaccio"}," ",{"t":"Anima of Mortaccio","r":"weapon:anima-of-mortaccio"}," upon reaching level 80."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Relic","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["9 February 2023 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["RELIC_MALACHITE"]]},{"label":"Effects","cells":[["Morphs ",{"t":"Mortaccio","r":"character:mortaccio"}," at level 80 into a stronger form that evolves their ",{"t":"main weapon","r":"weapon:anima-of-mortaccio"},"."]]},{"label":"Location","cells":[["Appear somewhere near the player at the center of a large square of Diamonds at the 18:00 min mark in ",{"t":"Bat Country","r":"stage:bat-country"},"."]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"obtaining","title":"Obtaining","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["At minute 18:02 in Bat Country, Chaos Malachite will appear somewhere near the player at the center of a large square of Diamonds. Its location is tracked by a green arrow on the player's screen. Once collected, it will no longer appear on the map. If not collected quickly enough, it will despawn 1 minute after appearing."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Chaos Malachite can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"gottagofast\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Chaos_Malachite_(old).png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["The old design of Chaos Malachite icon."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["hidden 17 August 2023 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Updated icon."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 1 June 2023 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Option to Seal the Chaos Malachite relic - Prevents Mortaccio from morphing when he reaches LV80"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 9 February 2023 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Chaos Malachite, ",{"i":"Sprite-Chaos_Rosalia.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:chaos-rosalia"}," ",{"t":"Chaos Rosalia","r":"relic:chaos-rosalia"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Chaos_Lazulia.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:chaos-lazulia"}," ",{"t":"Chaos Lazulia","r":"relic:chaos-lazulia"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Chaos_Altemanna.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:chaos-altemanna"}," ",{"t":"Chaos Altemanna","r":"relic:chaos-altemanna"}," are likely references to the ",{"t":"Chaos Emeralds","x":"https://sonic.fandom.com/wiki/Chaos_Emerald"}," from the ",{"t":"Sonic the Hedgehog","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sonic_the_Hedgehog"}," game series. They are gems that hold miraculous powers, one of the most well known being the ability to initiate super transformations."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["The spell \"gottagofast\" is also a nod to the series."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]}]}